        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>鹅口疮、胃十二指肠溃疡、小儿腹泻脱水表现</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #222;\n    max-width: 620px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px 15px;\n    background: #fff;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  h2.section-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 22px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .subtitle-bar {\n    background: #dfe6ee;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 5px 0;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  table th, table td {\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    padding: 4px 6px;\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  table th {\n    background: #dfe6ee;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  td.rowhead {\n    background: #eef1f6;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  p.note {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    margin: 4px 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 470px;\n    left: 15%;\n    transform: rotate(-20deg);\n    color: rgba(180,180,180,0.5);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"watermark\">[illegible watermark text]</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">14. 鹅口疮与外阴阴道假丝酵母菌病</h2>\n<div class=\"subtitle-bar\">鹅口疮与外阴阴道假丝酵母菌病异同点</div>\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>疾病</th>\n    <th>鹅口疮</th>\n    <th>外阴阴道假丝酵母菌病</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">致病菌</td>\n    <td>白色念珠菌</td>\n    <td>白色念珠菌</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">临床表现</td>\n    <td>口腔黏膜白色乳凝块</td>\n    <td>白带呈豆渣样</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">治疗</td>\n    <td>2%碳酸氢钠</td>\n    <td>2%~4%碳酸氢钠</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<p class=\"note\">注: 白色念珠菌属于真菌, 又名为白假丝酵母菌</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">15. 胃溃疡和十二指肠溃疡</h2>\n<div class=\"subtitle-bar\">胃溃疡和十二指肠溃疡的特点</div>\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>胃溃疡(GU)</th>\n    <th>十二指肠溃疡(DU)</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">病变部位</td>\n    <td>胃角和胃窦小弯</td>\n    <td>球部前壁</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">发病机制</td>\n    <td>主要是保护因素减弱</td>\n    <td>主要是侵袭因素增强</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">疼痛部位</td>\n    <td>剑突下正中或偏左</td>\n    <td>上腹正中或偏右</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">疼痛性质</td>\n    <td>烧灼感或痉挛感</td>\n    <td>饥饿感或烧灼痛</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">疼痛时间</td>\n    <td>餐后痛即进食后0.5~1小时出现,至下餐前消失</td>\n    <td>空腹痛即进食后2~3小时出现,下次进餐后缓解,可有夜间痛</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">疼痛节律</td>\n    <td>进食-疼痛-缓解</td>\n    <td>疼痛-进食-缓解</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">16. 小儿腹泻脱水临床表现</h2>\n<div class=\"subtitle-bar\">不同程度脱水的临床表现</div>\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>脱水程度</th>\n    <th>轻度</th>\n    <th>中度</th>\n    <th>重度</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">体重减少</td>\n    <td>&lt;5%</td>\n    <td>5%~10%</td>\n    <td>&gt;10%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">皮肤、黏膜</td>\n    <td>弹性可,稍干燥</td>\n    <td>弹性差,干燥</td>\n    <td>弹性极差,极干燥</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">眼窝、前囟</td>\n    <td>稍凹陷</td>\n    <td>明显凹陷</td>\n    <td>深度凹陷</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">尿量</td>\n    <td>略少</td>\n    <td>明显减少</td>\n    <td>少尿/无尿</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">末梢循环</td>\n    <td>正常</td>\n    <td>四肢稍凉</td>\n    <td>四肢厥冷</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"rowhead\">精神状态</td>\n    <td>稍差</td>\n    <td>烦躁、萎靡</td>\n    <td>昏睡/昏迷</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<p class=\"note\">注: 轻度往往描述为稍或略, 重度往往描述为极或无</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
